:INFO
Art. 33 Commencement
1 This Ordinance enters into force on 1 January 2013, subject to paragraphs 2 and 3.
2 The provisions of Articles 5 to 10 enter into force for non-systemically important banks on 1 January 2014.
3 The provisions of Chapter 4 enter into force on the 15th day of the month following approval by the Federal Assembly.

